BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 792.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (1. WHAT IS TXT2PDF?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (txt2pdf is a zero-dependency command-line utility that converts plain text) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (files into structured PDF 1.4 documents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (Unlike Pandoc, wkhtmltopdf, or Python-based converters that require hundreds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (of megabytes of runtime dependencies, txt2pdf is a small static binary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (It parses text, calculates page breaks, generates PDF objects, and writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (the final binary stream directly to disk using only the C standard library.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (It is designed for environments where installing dependencies is impossible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (unwanted, or where the network is down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (2. WHAT IS NEW IN V1.7?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (Version 1.7 adds the two most requested Spartan features:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (- Base14 font selection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (- Standalone block images.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (Main changes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (- Added --sans, --serif and --mono options.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (- Added Helvetica and Times-Roman Base14 font support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (- Added proportional text wrapping using built-in ASCII metrics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (- Added [IMG]...[/IMG] standalone image support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (- Added JPEG passthrough using native PDF DCTDecode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (- Added simple PNG passthrough using native PDF FlateDecode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (- Added debug diagnostics for detected images.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (- Kept the project dependency-free and single-file friendly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (The default behavior remains unchanged:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- Courier is still the default font.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (- Existing v1.6 documents should convert exactly as before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (- Images and proportional fonts are opt-in features.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (3. FONTS AND TYPOGRAPHY) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (txt2pdf v1.7 supports the standard PDF Base14 font families.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (Available options:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (- --mono) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (    Use Courier. This is the default and the classic txt2pdf layout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (- --sans) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 144.00 Td (    Use Helvetica. This gives a clean, modern, proportional look.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (- --serif) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (    Use Times-Roman. This gives a classic documentation look.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (Examples:) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
