BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (- Base14 fonts are not embedded into the PDF.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (- PDF viewers normally provide built-in substitutes for Base14 fonts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (- Courier layout remains fixed-width and highly predictable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (- Helvetica and Times-Roman use built-in ASCII metrics for line wrapping.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (- Accents and non-ASCII characters remain limited to WinAnsiEncoding.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
