BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (- interlaced PNGs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (- 16-bit channels) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (- palette transparency) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (Image layout behavior:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (- Images are treated as standalone content blocks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (- Aspect ratio is preserved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (- Images wider than the text area are scaled down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (- Images taller than the page are scaled down to fit.) Tj ET
endstream
